{"file_id":"BRIEFING_MISSION_BLOCK_37D9F0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Snake，能占用你一点时间吗？\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"什么事？\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":13,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"是Paz的事……。\n……你也知道，她已经没有亲人了。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":71,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"她似乎通过Zadornov拿到奖学金，\n一直住在学校的宿舍里，\n可Zadornov是KGB的人……。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":109,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"那笔所谓的奖学金似乎也是KGB提供的。\n就算Zadornov获释，\n以后应该也不会再有钱给Paz了。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":119,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"反正也不是什么干净的钱。\n这样不是正好吗。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":62,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"所以……。\n我想暂时让Paz留在<R= 这里 ,MOTHER BASE>。\n","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R= 这里 ,MOTHER BASE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":68,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"Paz怎么说？\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":16,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"她说“无论如何都想帮上点忙”。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":46,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"不过，这终究只是暂时的安排。\n这次的事对她造成的打击还没有消退。\n现在应该没有谁比我们更理解她了。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":144,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"知道了。\n不过Kaz，别让她离开你的视线。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":56,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"嗯？什么意思？\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":22,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"让她习惯这里的生活，\n对Paz来说并不是什么好事吧。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":71,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"我知道，Snake。\n我不是想把她变成士兵。\n之后你也亲自听听她怎么说吧。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":98,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"嗯。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":7,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"另外，Strangelove博士也说，\n她想来Mother Base。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"Strangelove也要来？\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"她现在也没了工作，\n而且回国似乎也会有各种麻烦。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":71,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"详细情况你去问她吧。\n至于她作为研发人员的能力……\n……应该不用我多说了。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":""}]}